member.summary:
To use the unity message methods that are already declared in the
 base class, do the following:

protected new void Awake() { // Same for other messages
	// Something to do before base class method
	base.Awake();
	// Something to do after base class method
}

Do NOT omit the call to base class method unless you know what you
are doing.

summary.para:
The following snippet is a naive implementation of shuffle algorithm:

System.Random random = new();
enumerable.OrderBy(i => random.Next());

It is simple, yet not performant, and is biased. So always prefer this implementation over that one.
